,"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I am taking bounty #32187 and will open an implementation PR with validation details.","createdAt":"2026-02-15T12:08:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-3904318889","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pE0Lh","author":{"login":"Dairus01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT trust you are doing great. It's Monday already, and @mahmudsudo is yet to drop a PR please can you assign this issue to me I would love to work on it","createdAt":"2026-02-16T20:12:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-3910353633","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pYHSd","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @Dairus01 for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nIf you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n\nLet me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!","createdAt":"2026-02-17T15:33:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-3915412637","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pwet3","author":{"login":"Dairus01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT . \n\nI have a functional Stage 1 implementation (reference model + TTNN functional pipeline with torch fallbacks), but I need access to a Tenstorrent device to:\n1. Run and fix the test suite\n2. Replace torch ops with real TTNN ops (linear, layer_norm, etc.)\n3. Validate PCC ≥ 0.99 against the reference model\n4. Performance benchmark\n\nCould you point me to cloud/developer hardware access options (Koyeb, Paperspace, or internal cloud)? Or is there a partner program for bounty contributors?\n\nAny guidance appreciated!","createdAt":"2026-02-18T16:25:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-3921800055","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pwwAV","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @Dairus01 , thanks for the great update! I can absolutely provide you with Koyeb access!\n\nPlease email me at jberkowitz@tenstorrent.com with how long you think you'll need (you can include some extra buffer time) & I'll send you some coupon codes","createdAt":"2026-02-18T16:39:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-3921870869","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pxWso","author":{"login":"Dairus01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @jberkowitzTT, I really appreciate it. Please check your emails.","createdAt":"2026-02-18T17:07:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-3922029352","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc875d3bD","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Can I try this? I'm surprised this hasn't been done for a month now, can I take this and submit before the assigned user? Or is the assigned user still active on this??","createdAt":"2026-04-03T21:51:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4185355971","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc875f59V","author":{"login":"Dairus01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@0x-aut  I am still active on this my pr us being reviewed ","createdAt":"2026-04-04T01:01:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4185890645","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc875kmBg","author":{"login":"Muhammadhassan1226"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi ! Can i countiue with this bounty ! I just complete my Ai training from well known Insitititue","createdAt":"2026-04-04T13:29:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4187119712","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc875kwyd","author":{"login":"Dairus01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@Muhammadhassan1226 \n\n> Hi ! Can i countiue with this bounty ! I just complete my Ai training from well known Insitititue\n\nRead the comments section and the attached Pull Request there is nothing for you to do, I am waiting for my PR review","createdAt":"2026-04-04T14:04:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4187163805","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABBYX_mw","author":{"login":"ayewo"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT \nI'm available to help with this in case it gets reopened. Thanks!","createdAt":"2026-05-06T11:51:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4387635099","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABBuptjw","author":{"login":"sreeshanth-soma"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT if the assignee is not working, I would love to work on this","createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:38:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4410994063","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABB4-fyA","author":{"login":"Dairus01"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi @jberkowitzTT if the assignee is not working, I would love to work on this\n\nI am working on it, I am optimizing the code to meet the requirements please relax","createdAt":"2026-05-11T14:51:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4421820360","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABB5JwLA","author":{"login":"sreeshanth-soma"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Sounds good 👍 Looking forward to seeing the final Optimized results.","createdAt":"2026-05-11T15:13:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4422004780","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABCX7F3g","author":{"login":"zp6"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #32187\n\nI would like to work on this bounty.\n\nGitHub: @zp6","createdAt":"2026-05-14T20:00:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4454270430","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABCZMyPA","author":{"login":"morhimanshu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I would also like to work on this bounty.","createdAt":"2026-05-14T23:40:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4455608892","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABC7_5WA","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@0x-aut - are you still interested in this bounty? Please let me know by tomorrow\n\nThanks!","createdAt":"2026-05-19T21:13:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HOORAY","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4492097880","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABC8BECQ","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> @0x-aut - are you still interested in this bounty? Please let me know by tomorrow\n> \n> Thanks!\n\n100% I'm interested.","createdAt":"2026-05-19T21:16:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4492117001","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABC8Butw","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @0x-aut for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 2 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nIf you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n\nLet me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!","createdAt":"2026-05-19T21:18:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4492127927","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABC8DMXQ","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Thanks @0x-aut for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 2 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n> \n> Review our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n> \n> If you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n> \n> Let me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!\n\nWill do, I'll start looking into the code, will comment if I need anything, thanks","createdAt":"2026-05-19T21:21:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4492151901","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABC8lwKA","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT hello, seems i will be needing access to the hardware on the cloud, thank you\nEDIT: Is it possible to request for the N150 and the N300 for testing or I can only access just one (its fine either way)","createdAt":"2026-05-19T22:47:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4492718120","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABC-eBHw","author":{"login":"debaa98"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"hey @jberkowitzTT can you assign me into this issue ?","createdAt":"2026-05-20T05:04:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4494688543","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABDAGvAg","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> hey [@jberkowitzTT](https://github.com/jberkowitzTT) can you assign me into this issue ?\n\nAlready on it man, let's see how it goes first yeah?","createdAt":"2026-05-20T08:49:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4496404226","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABDQ0aZQ","author":{"login":"msalvi123"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Can someone from TT clarify whether HW is needed to verify the effectiveness of the fix? cc @jberkowitzTT ","createdAt":"2026-05-22T00:39:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"EYES","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4513929829","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABDYdcJQ","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Typically, hardware access (including cloud access) does help verify the effectiveness, but isn't absolutely necessary. We have checks on our side, but hardware access helps test it without us needing to run the tests each time","createdAt":"2026-05-22T19:00:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4521942053","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABDfIX3A","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT so a bit of a status update before the 2 weeks are up. Cloned the tt-metal repo, and the llvc repo, porting the model for llvc right now into tt, so i am currently writing tests and torch functions for it, almost done with those, then will write the tests and torch functions for the minimalrvc and the minimalquickvc, once i am done with the root model though i will be porting to ttnn as the docs recommend, yeah. will let you know when i need hardware access to test what I have written so far. Thanks","createdAt":"2026-05-24T13:55:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4528936924","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABEAw2cQ","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT Made a little bit of a mistake, want to open my first PR but i cloned repo, will instead fork and make a PR. made a new branch though so if i can make a PR with that still that'd be lovely. PR is so you can see the progress on how I am working on it","createdAt":"2026-05-28T13:00:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4564203121","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABEI2a_g","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT Just read that I can open an issue for write request? could I please request for write access so i can push my branch for the PR?","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:38:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4572683006","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABEfQzEQ","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Uh...is there a break i don't know about, here feels kind of inactive? uhm, still working on this by the way, will be done with stage 1 and possibly stage 2 by thursday and saturday respectively (I'd need hardware access by thursday)","createdAt":"2026-06-01T20:21:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4596183825","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABEfm7xg","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @0x-aut - my apologies for the delay! I'm not sure why I wasn't getting notified before, but it's working now\n\nThe best way is to just fork tt-metal and open the PR from your fork, so you won't need write access for this. If CI/action permissions block anything on the fork PR, we can help rerun/approve those on our side.","createdAt":"2026-06-01T21:10:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4596546502","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABEfr2Yw","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"For the hardware access, please email me at jberkowitz@tenstorrent.com & I can provide you with some access!\n","createdAt":"2026-06-01T21:23:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4596627043","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABFqaL-A","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @0x-aut - wanted to check in to see how things are going or if there's anything else I can do to help","createdAt":"2026-06-10T21:55:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4674980856","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABFqbf6g","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi [@0x-aut](https://github.com/0x-aut) - wanted to check in to see how things are going or if there's anything else I can do to help\n\nOh nothing for now @jberkowitzTT been a bit busy during the week so I havent pushed, decided to convert first and test everything at once so PR will soon be released, will email if i need hardware access. Thanks :) ","createdAt":"2026-06-10T21:57:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4675002346","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABFqcEWQ","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Not a problem, thanks for the update!","createdAt":"2026-06-10T21:58:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4675011673","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABH-oigg","author":{"login":"0x-aut"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT Hey, super super sorry for this, I have become extremely busy with work, more than the usual so I am afraid I cannot find free time to work on this anymore, If its not much of a bother, you can assign this issue to someone else, I dont mind sharing the code I have written so far with them since I am sure they would find it helpful, I really dont want this project to drag on to the deadline and I have not delivered anything so I'd rather you give the issue out. Super sorry for this, ","createdAt":"2026-06-29T08:22:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4830405250","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABH-rHLQ","author":{"login":"k1shna"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT I would like to work on this if possible, Thanks!","createdAt":"2026-06-29T08:27:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4830447405","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABH_QU9g","author":{"login":"sreeshanth-soma"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT, if this bounty gets reassigned, I'd be happy to take it on. My other TT bounty is almost completed (currently awaiting merge), so I'll be available to focus on this one. Thanks for your consideration!","createdAt":"2026-06-29T09:41:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4831057142","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABI3-_iA","author":{"login":"samiyadev786"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT I hope you're doing well. Since @0x-aut has given up this bounty, could you please consider assigning it to me?\n\n> I've successfully completed and had several previous bounty submissions merged, and I'm currently available to work on a new one. If assigned, I'll start right away and aim to deliver it as soon as possible.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T08:12:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4890541960","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABI_BUYw","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi all! I will look to reassign this at the end of this week","createdAt":"2026-07-06T21:49:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4897920099","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABI_fLlw","author":{"login":"ayewo"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT \nRegarding the reassignment at the end of the week, I'm still interested.\n\nPS: I've commented before on [May 6](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4387635099) but due to the long stream of comments after mine, the GitHub UI is collapsing my comment by default. \n","createdAt":"2026-07-06T23:06:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4898409367","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABJBcPvw","author":{"login":"samiyadev786"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Here's a polished and respectful version:\n\n> @jberkowitzTT I hope you're doing well. Thank you for the update.\n>\n> When you reassign the issue at the end of the week, could you please consider assigning it to me?\n>\n> I've successfully completed several previous bounty issues, all of which have been merged. I'm currently available and ready to start immediately. If assigned, I'll do my best to deliver the bounty as quickly as possible.\n>\n> Thank you for your consideration!\n","createdAt":"2026-07-07T05:25:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187#issuecomment-4900458431","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2025-11-10T18:07:10Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MNMtg","name":"bounty","description":"","color":"aaaaaa"},{"id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MQ32A","name":"bounty_difficulty/medium","description":"Medium Bounty","color":"EE8199"},{"id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAACNAiXkw","name":"model bringup","description":"For model initialization or bring-up stage bounties","color":"fa8c2b"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"[Bounty $1500] LLVC (Low-Latency Low-Resource Voice Conversion) bring up using TTNN APIs","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T05:25:26Z","url":"https://github.com